@host = http://localhost:5036

### R1 empty list -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/v1/print/token
Content-Type: application/json

{ "musicSheetIds": [] }

### R2 unknown id -> 404
POST {{host}}/api/v1/print/token
Content-Type: application/json

{ "musicSheetIds": [999] }

### R3 wrong token -> 404
GET {{host}}/api/v1/print/print-information?token=falsch

### R4 token-information wrong token -> 404
GET {{host}}/api/v1/print/token-information?token=falsch

### R5 file wrong token -> 404
GET {{host}}/api/v1/print/file/1?token=falsch

### R6 token for sheets 1,2,3 with folder 1 -> 200 + token
# @name createToken
POST {{host}}/api/v1/print/token
Content-Type: application/json

{ "musicSheetIds": [1, 2, 3], "musicFolderId": 1 }

### R7 print-information with real token -> 200, 3 settings
GET {{host}}/api/v1/print/print-information?token={{createToken.response.body.$.token}}

### R8 token-information -> 200, numbers 12 / 12a / 2
GET {{host}}/api/v1/print/token-information?token={{createToken.response.body.$.token}}

### R9 file 1 -> 200, PDF
GET {{host}}/api/v1/print/file/1?token={{createToken.response.body.$.token}}

### R10 file 99 (not in token) -> 404
GET {{host}}/api/v1/print/file/99?token={{createToken.response.body.$.token}}